<div class="page-head"><h1>About Inkwell Lane</h1></div>
<div class="prose">
  <p>Inkwell Lane opened in 2019 as a narrow, book-lined shop on XYZ Street — two booksellers, a reading chair by the window and a strong opinion about every title on the shelf.</p>
  <p>We are still independent, and still small on purpose. Every book in our catalog is chosen by a bookseller who has read it, and we only stock titles we would happily hand to a friend. Online, we keep the same promise: a short, well-chosen shelf instead of an endless warehouse.</p>
  <h2>How ordering works</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Add books to your cart and check out with your delivery details — no account needed.</li>
    <li>We pack your order within 24 hours and call you to confirm before dispatch.</li>
    <li>You pay in cash when the books arrive. Track every order from <a href="/orders">My Orders</a>.</li>
  </ol>
  <h2>Delivery</h2>
  <p>Free delivery on orders above ₹999. Orders usually arrive within 3–6 working days.</p>
  <h2>Our promise</h2>
  <p>Fair prices, careful packing and honest recommendations. If a book reaches you damaged, or it is the wrong title, we replace it within 7 days — no forms, no arguments.</p>
</div>
